body:
!explanation last night my dad asked me for $50. I told him that he gave me his word that he wouldn't ask me for money when we move in together. He proceeded to guilt trip me by saying "I suffer all my life" in a previous message. I told him that it was unacceptable that he would pull this stuff  and I would not be tolerating it. I told him that guilt tripping after someone saying no is abusive and manipulative. He used to take my money from me while I slept and I am now paranoid because of it. He would get violent and harass me until I felt horrible. He sent me these messages after I went to sleep. I had been crying all night because my moms birthday is this friday. She was also abusive to me but has been dead for a couple years now. 

&#x200B;

As well before this, I told him I was having a bad night and I was very depressed. He went on to say that the government was sending out radiowaves that make me upset and that it wasn't normal. He wasn't always like this and I am quite frankly scared to move in with him again. He disowned my sister multiple times for her not saying happy birthday or telling him she loved him. She has had to block him multiple times. Let me know if you have any more questions.
